       CLA     I                  SET TO READ                           TSSB0089
       TSX     $(TSH),4           INITIAL TEMPERATURES.                 TSSB0090
               FMT1,0,1                                                 TSSB0091
       AXT     4,2                SET CARD COUNT.                       TSSB0092
