       TXL     *-7,1,NB           AND NOT OUT OF RANGE,                 TSSB0104
TBND   CLM                        SET AC=-0                             TSSB0105
       CAS     IB+NB+1,1          TEST FOR                              TSSB0106
       TRA     *+3                TEMPERATURE CONNECTOR                 TSSB0107
       TRA     *+2                OR CONSTANT TEMPERATURE.              TSSB0108
