       STR                        THE TIME. AFTER READING               TSSB0163
TX2    AXT     **,2               THE CARD, CONTINUE                    TSSB0164
       TRA     TRN                TO NEXT CARD.                         TSSB0165
TRDER  STR                        READ TEMPEATURE.                      TSSB0166
       XCA                        IF TEMP IS                            TSSB0167
       TPL     *+2                NON-BLANK, PROCEED,                   TSSB0168
       TZE     1,2                BLANK, RETURN.                        TSSB0169
