TLEV   XEC     TX2                AFTER ALL TABLES HAVE                 TSSB0184
       PXD     0,1                BEEN READ, SAVE                       TSSB0185
       STO     IB+1,2             COUNT OF LAST TABLE                   TSSB0186
       TSX     $(RTN),4           AND PROCEED TO NEXT PHASE.            TSSB0187
